---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'
const updated = 'July 2026'
---
<Layout title="Refund Policy — QuoteLens" description="QuoteLens refund and cancellation policy.">

  <section class="legal">
    <p class="eyebrow">QuoteLens</p>
    <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <h2>Free to start</h2>
    <p>
      You can create a QuoteLens account and set up your products without
      paying. You only pay when you activate a paid plan.
    </p>

    <h2>Cancelling</h2>
    <p>
      There is no separate cancellation step. A paid period runs for 30
      days from activation; if you don't renew before it ends, your quote
      page simply stops accepting customer quotes until you renew again.
      Your account, configuration, and data are retained either way.
    </p>

    <h2>Refunds</h2>
    <p>
      Payments are non-refundable, including for the unused portion of a
      paid period if you stop using QuoteLens partway through. If you
      believe you were charged in error, or the service failed to work as
      described, contact us and we will review it case by case.
    </p>

    <h2>AI credits</h2>
    <p>
      AI features are not currently limited by a credit system — usage is
      included as part of your plan. If usage limits are introduced in the
      future, this page will be updated to explain how they work.
    </p>

    <h2>Getting in touch</h2>
    <p>
      For anything about billing, write to
      <a href="mailto:quotelensapp@gmail.com">quotelensapp@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <p class="back"><a href="/">← Back to QuoteLens</a></p>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>